   1.00 Release



FAST TIPS FOR 1.00
---------------------------
Please consult the 'UniQuest MPD24 Quick Start' 
PDF document for complete instructions on configuring
and using this software, and for information on the
custom preset editor components by Psicraft Designs.

For in depth instructions on program operations and the
Midi Quest architectural components by Sound Quest, 
please consult the Midi Quest Manual PDF document.

On Windows installations, these documents are 
located in 

   X:\Program Files\Sound Quest\UniQuest Editors\
     Akai Pro\MPD24

      Where X is the drive letter you have installed to. 



On Mac installations, these documents are located in 

   Documents : Sound Quest : UniQuest MPD24











